{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05260","headline":"奉和圣制立春日侍宴内殿出剪彩花应制 · 赵彦昭","name":"奉和圣制立春日侍宴内殿出剪彩花应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"剪彩迎初候，攀条故写真。\n花随红意发，叶就绿情新。\n嫩色惊衔燕，轻香误采人。\n应爲熏风拂，能令芳树春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵彦昭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05260.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05260","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}